### ==========================================================
### CartController 接口测试 (IDEA HTTP Client)
### DTO: AddItemRequest(skuId, productId, title, image, price, quantity, guestToken)
### 约束: skuId @NotNull | price @NotNull | quantity @Min(1)@Max(999)
### ==========================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiIxMDAxIn0.replace_me
@guestToken = guest-token-001
@skuId = 10001

### ---------- 1. 购物车列表 + 合计（登录态） ----------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### ---------- 1b. 购物车列表（游客态，走 X-Guest-Token） ----------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart
X-Guest-Token: {{guestToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ---------- 1c. 游客态且无 token（应返回空列表） ----------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart
Accept: application/json

### ---------- 2. 汇总信息 quantity / types / total ----------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### ---------- 3. 加购（登录态） ----------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skuId": 10001,
  "productId": 2001,
  "title": "示例商品 SKU-10001",
  "image": "https://cdn.example.com/p/2001.jpg",
  "price": 129.90,
  "quantity": 2,
  "guestToken": null
}

### ---------- 3b. 加购（游客态，guestToken 必填） ----------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skuId": 10001,
  "productId": 2001,
  "title": "示例商品 SKU-10001",
  "image": "https://cdn.example.com/p/2001.jpg",
  "price": 129.90,
  "quantity": 2,
  "guestToken": "{{guestToken}}"
}

### ---------- 3c. 加购 最小必填（productId/title/image/guestToken 全省略，DTO 无约束） ----------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skuId": 10002,
  "price": 9.90,
  "quantity": 1
}

### ---------- 3d. 异常用例：quantity = 0（违反 @Min(1)，应 400） ----------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skuId": 10001,
  "productId": 2001,
  "title": "示例商品",
  "image": "https://cdn.example.com/p/2001.jpg",
  "price": 129.90,
  "quantity": 0,
  "guestToken": null
}

### ---------- 3e. 异常用例：quantity = 1000（违反 @Max(999)，应 400） ----------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skuId": 10001,
  "productId": 2001,
  "title": "示例商品",
  "image": "https://cdn.example.com/p/2001.jpg",
  "price": 129.90,
  "quantity": 1000,
  "guestToken": null
}

### ---------- 3f. 异常用例：skuId = null（违反 @NotNull，应 400） ----------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skuId": null,
  "productId": 2001,
  "title": "示例商品",
  "image": "https://cdn.example.com/p/2001.jpg",
  "price": 129.90,
  "quantity": 1,
  "guestToken": null
}

### ---------- 3g. 异常用例：price = null（违反 @NotNull，应 400） ----------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "skuId": 10001,
  "productId": 2001,
  "title": "示例商品",
  "image": "https://cdn.example.com/p/2001.jpg",
  "price": null,
  "quantity": 1,
  "guestToken": null
}

### ---------- 3h. 异常用例：空 body {}（skuId/price/quantity 三项缺失，应 400） ----------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ---------- 4. 改数量（204 无 body） ----------
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items/{{skuId}}/quantity?quantity=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- 4b. 改数量 边界：quantity = 1 ----------
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items/{{skuId}}/quantity?quantity=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- 4c. 改数量 边界：quantity = 999 ----------
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items/{{skuId}}/quantity?quantity=999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- 4d. 改数量 异常：quantity = 1000（需类上加 @Validated 才会 400，否则会穿透到 Service） ----------
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items/{{skuId}}/quantity?quantity=1000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- 4e. 改数量 异常：漏传 quantity（应 400，int 缺参） ----------
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items/{{skuId}}/quantity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- 5. 勾选 ----------
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items/{{skuId}}/selected?selected=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- 5b. 取消勾选 ----------
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items/{{skuId}}/selected?selected=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- 5c. 异常：selected 非布尔（应 400） ----------
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items/{{skuId}}/selected?selected=yes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- 6. 全选 ----------
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/select-all?selected=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- 6b. 全不选 ----------
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/select-all?selected=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- 7. 删除单个 ----------
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items/{{skuId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- 8. 清空购物车 ----------
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- 9. 登录后合并访客购物车（POST + query 参数） ----------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/merge?guestToken={{guestToken}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### ---------- 9b. 异常：漏传 guestToken（应 400，@RequestParam 默认 required） ----------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/merge
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### ---------- 10. 未登录访问写接口（应 401） ----------
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/items/{{skuId}}/quantity?quantity=1
Accept: application/json

### ---------- 10b. 未登录清空（应 401） ----------
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/cart
Accept: application/json
